w: Songs of thank- ful- ness and praise, Je- sus, Lord, to Thee we raise,
w: Man- i- fest at Jor- dan's stream, Pro- phet, Priest, and King su- preme;
w: Man- i- fest in mak- ing whole Pal- sied limbs and faint- ing soul;
w: Sun and moon shall dark- ened be, Stars shall fall, the heav'ns shall flee,
w: Grant us grace to see Thee, Lord, Mir- rored in Thy ho- ly Word;
